    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d457">

                <pb facs="0590" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg505"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.77/25</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Jusserand</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-11-27"><hi rendition="#italic">November 27,
                        1918</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: My Government informs me
                    that the French Colonial Society for Commerce and Industries has filed with the
                    Liberian Government, an application for a harbor at Monrovia and a railway
                    connecting that town with the Franco-Liberian boundary. American interests are
                    to share in that undertaking.</p>
                <p>The application is to be laid before the Liberian Congress that will meet on
                    December 2d next, and my Government would attach great value to having the
                    Federal Government kindly instruct its <pb facs="0591" n="506" xml:id="pg506"/>
                    representative at Monrovia to support the action which his French colleague has
                    been directed to take in the matter.</p>
                <p>I should be very thankful to Your Excellency if you would kindly let me know the
                    decision you may see fit to reach in the case.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jusserand</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
